      "text": "Rage of Bahamut: Manaria Friends\nis a Japanese anime television series based on the Rage of Bahamut social game . The series is not related to the second season of the earlier Rage of Bahamut : Genesis anime . It was originally scheduled to premiere in April 2016 , before being postponed indefinitely ."
