    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 566,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Flaked\nFlaked is an American comedy web television series that stars Will Arnett , who developed it alongside the creator/executive producer of Arrested Development , Mitch Hurwitz . The first season consisted of eight episodes , which were released simultaneously worldwide on March 11 , 2016 . In July 2016 , the series was renewed for a six-episode second season , which is scheduled to premiere on June 2 , 2017 . Columnist Cindy Elavsky describes the show as being about `` a self-help guru named Chip who 's struggling to stay a step ahead of his own lies . ''"
     }
